WEBVTT

00:00:03.222 --> 00:00:07.662
Reports on agents' time read every state change of every agent.

00:00:07.662 --> 00:00:14.677
These are all the Workforce and Payroll reports, plus Agent presence audit and Agent activity timeline.

00:00:14.677 --> 00:00:18.152
Here is Agent time summary for the last 30 days.

00:00:18.628 --> 00:00:22.952
To keep them fast, they cover at most 31 days at a time.

00:00:22.952 --> 00:00:25.811
Choose Last 90 Days and click Show.

00:00:25.811 --> 00:00:30.833
The report says This period is too long for this report, names the

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:33.832
longest period, and shows no figures.

00:00:33.832 --> 00:00:37.808
Other Contact Center reports accept up to 400 days.

00:00:38.264 --> 00:00:42.041
Go back to a shorter period and the figures return.

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.361
An export has the same limit.

00:00:44.361 --> 00:00:49.264
On screen, Agent presence audit lists the most recent 5,000 changes:

00:00:49.264 --> 00:00:52.974
pick an agent or a shorter period to see the rest.

